TIP:  The numbers at the end of the first verse as well as the coda are the frets to pick the first string, followed by a single strum of |DaddA| which is just (D) with your pinky extended to cover the 1st string/5th fret.

TIP:  For the 2nd and 4th verse and the reprise there are single lead-in strums of |G| and |A| followed by the first (D) of the line. 
  
   
